        "collapsible-description": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Description",
            "content": "<p>AutoLinkr Dash Pro™ is a true 4K dual-channel dash camera that captures the road ahead in 3840×2160 UHD and the road behind in 1080P FHD — simultaneously, automatically, every time you start your car.<\/p><p>At its core is the STARVIS 2 image sensor paired with F1.5 and F1.8 large-aperture lenses and 6-layer optical glass. Combined with WDR + HDR processing, the result is footage clear enough to read license plates and street signs in daylight, glare, and after dark — exactly when you need that evidence most.<\/p><p>A 170° front field of view and 140° rear field of view dramatically reduce blind spots. Built-in GPS embeds location, speed, and route directly into your recordings — so every clip is timestamped, mapped, and ready to share. Built-in WiFi lets you preview, download, and send clips to your phone wirelessly through the AutoLinkr app, with OTA firmware updates handled the same way.<\/p><p>G-sensor collision detection automatically locks any impact footage so it's never overwritten by loop recording. With the optional hardwire kit, 24H Parking Monitor mode keeps the camera watching even when your car is off — motion and impact triggered, with a low-power time-lapse option for full-day surveillance.<\/p><p>One install. Continuous coverage. Evidence-grade footage, front and rear, day and night.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "collapsible-specs": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Full Specifications",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Front Camera:<\/strong> 4K UHD (3840×2160)<\/li><li><strong>Rear Camera:<\/strong> 1080P FHD<\/li><li><strong>Image Sensor:<\/strong> STARVIS 2<\/li><li><strong>Aperture:<\/strong> F1.5 (front) + F1.8 (rear)<\/li><li><strong>Lens:<\/strong> 6-layer optical glass<\/li><li><strong>Field of View:<\/strong> 170° front · 140° rear<\/li><li><strong>Screen:<\/strong> 3.18″ IPS<\/li><li><strong>Image Processing:<\/strong> WDR + HDR<\/li><li><strong>GPS:<\/strong> Built-in (location, speed, and route embedded into footage)<\/li><li><strong>WiFi:<\/strong> Built-in 2.4 GHz (iOS + Android app)<\/li><li><strong>OTA Updates:<\/strong> Wireless firmware over WiFi<\/li><li><strong>Loop Recording:<\/strong> Auto-overwrites oldest footage<\/li><li><strong>G-Sensor:<\/strong> Auto-locks impact footage from overwrite<\/li><li><strong>Parking Monitor:<\/strong> 24H motion + impact mode (requires hardwire kit, sold separately)<\/li><li><strong>Night Vision:<\/strong> STARVIS 2 + IR-enhanced low-light<\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 64GB SD card included, supports up to 256GB<\/li><li><strong>Voltage:<\/strong> 12–24V input (5V device, 5W consumption)<\/li><li><strong>Working Temperature:<\/strong> -30°C to +50°C<\/li><li><strong>Mounting:<\/strong> 180° rotating slider mount, 3M adhesive + electrostatic sticker<\/li><li><strong>In the Box:<\/strong> Front 4K cam, 1080P rear cam, GPS-built-in mount, 64GB SD card, 21.3 ft rear camera cable, 11.5 ft power cable with 12V car charger, 2 electrostatic stickers<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "collapsible-install": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Installation & Setup",
            "content": "<p><strong>Setup takes about 30 minutes<\/strong> with no tools required:<\/p><ul><li>Apply the included electrostatic sticker to your windshield, then mount the front camera with the 3M adhesive pad on the 180° rotating slider mount<\/li><li>Route the 21.3 ft rear camera cable along your headliner and down to the rear window (cable length covers full-size SUVs and trucks)<\/li><li>Plug the front camera into your 12V power port using the included 11.5 ft power cable<\/li><li>For 24H Parking Monitor, install the hardwire kit (sold separately) into your fuse box — includes low-voltage cutoff to protect your battery<\/li><li>Pair your phone to the camera over built-in WiFi using the AutoLinkr app to preview live footage, download clips, and update firmware<\/li><\/ul><p>The camera powers on, locks in GPS, and starts recording automatically every time you start your vehicle.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "collapsible-shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "content": "<p>You can expect your <strong>AutoLinkr Dash Pro™<\/strong> within 5-10 business days from your order date.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
