    "multicolumn-features": {
      "type": "multicolumn-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "col-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "camera",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "4K Front + 1080P Rear",
            "text": "<p>True 4K UHD up front (3840×2160) and 1080P FHD behind — simultaneous, evidence-grade footage from both directions, every drive.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "col-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "moon",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "STARVIS 2 Night Vision",
            "text": "<p>The STARVIS 2 sensor with F1.5/F1.8 large-aperture lenses and WDR + HDR processing captures clear, readable footage even in low light — including license plates after dark.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "col-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "wifi",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "Built-in WiFi + GPS",
            "text": "<p>Preview live footage, download clips, and update firmware wirelessly through the AutoLinkr app. Built-in GPS embeds location, speed, and route into every recording.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "col-4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "clock",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "24H Parking Monitor",
            "text": "<p>With the optional hardwire kit, Dash Pro keeps watching even when your car is off — motion and impact triggered, with a low-power time-lapse mode for all-day surveillance.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "col-5": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "bolt",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "G-Sensor Collision Lock",
            "text": "<p>Any impact triggers the G-sensor to instantly lock and protect that footage from loop overwrite. Your evidence stays safe exactly when you need it most.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "col-6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "loop",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "Loop Recording",
            "text": "<p>Never worry about running out of storage. Loop recording auto-deletes the oldest footage to keep recording continuously — supports up to 256GB SD cards.<\/p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
