        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most dash cams produce grainy, unusable footage at night. AutoLinkr Dash Pro™ pairs the STARVIS 2 sensor with F1.5 and F1.8 large-aperture lenses, a 6-layer optical glass build, and WDR + HDR processing — delivering sharp, low-noise video even in complete darkness.<\/p><p>License plates. Road signs. Other vehicles. See them clearly — parked or moving, day or night.<\/p>",
